ub.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":118972215,"digest":"sha256:abd0a379973f744e1c91b933a8121264f9d79f17414b16b7e36192dd5f9dd5cd","download_count":7,"created_at":"2026-06-18T00:36:38Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T00:37:53Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.5.4/Advancely-v1.5.4-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.5.4","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.5.4","body":"## Looking at the amazing `1.16` `all_blocks` template reveals that Advancely needed more performance optimizations, which I finally tackled. The `Manual Layout` now also properly integrates culling (not performing any rendering calculations for items off-screen), which drastically improves performance when zooming in. Arguably way more crucial is the reduction of text/checkboxes being rendered, so I implemented a new setting that only reveals them within a certain radius of your mouse. This essentially boosts performance tremendously on bigger templates.\r\n<img width=\"575\" height=\"262\" alt=\"Cursor Reveal Radius Setting\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ecfba15e-a560-4897-8e07-063a71ef973e\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"513\" height=\"512\" alt=\"All_blocks_mouse_radius\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1644a911-4a0b-4104-8872-8f9339110e8e\" />\r\n\r\n### Besides the new `Cursor Reveal Radius` setting, there are a few more additions with this release:\r\n\r\n- Advancely should always stay free to use, but I have to incentivize users more to support, which is why I added a longer message into the welcome window, that similarly appears every 10 launches and after an auto-update.\r\n- Added a new `1.12` categorical template by [ScrambledMC](https://www.twitch.tv/supercuber58).\r\n<img width=\"2057\" height=\"1185\" alt=\"1 12 categorical template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2cd4e2bb-8885-4f6f-bf69-533185e8061a\" />\r\n\r\n- Added a new `1.16` `all_advancements` `_coop` template by [magnissima](https://www.twitch.tv/magnissima).\r\n<img width=\"1806\" height=\"1142\" alt=\"all_advancements coop template\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75daa04c-eb3d-419c-bce3-e5c7bcd5380a\" />\r\n\r\n- The `1.16` `all_blocks` template now carries a performance notice pointing at the new cursor radius setting.\r\n- Added plenty of 26.2 icon textures.\r\n- The `Style` advancement criteria, in newer `_categorical` templates, had their textures missing (supposed to be invisible, but added regardless).\r\n- Added [kittymmeow](https://www.twitch.tv/kittymmeow)'s amazing half-done background texture (as seen in the above screenshot with `Hot Tourist`, `AT`, `Monsters` and `ABD`).\r\n- Fixed `settings.json` writing issue for manual goals, where it would dump all of the `false` completions on full file sync and then on a single manual completions it would revert, but keep `.criteria` and set it to `true` even for non-complex stats.\r\n- Updated the documentation with these additions.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}